{
  "title": "信创行业标准化建设有望实现新突破",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>07</span><font>2024.06</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>信创行业标准化建设有望实现新突破</h2> <b>2024.06.07</b> <h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">近日，</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: 32px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">中央网信办、市场监管总局、工业和信息化部联合印发</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">《信息化标准建设行动计划（2024—2027年）》，</span><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">标志着信创行业标准化建设有望实现新的突破。</strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">《行动计划》强调，信息化标准是国家标准体系的重要组成部分，是以信息化驱动引领高质量发展的重要支撑，要以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想特别是习近平总书记关于网络强国的重要思想为指导，深入贯彻党的二十大精神，认真落实党中央、国务院关于信息化发展和标准化工作的决策部署，完善信息化标准体系、提升标准化基础能力、健全工作机制、强化标准实施、增强国际影响力，以标准建设支撑引领信息化发展，为加快建设全国统一大市场，培育壮大新质生产力提供有力支撑。</span><br/></h1><p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">信息技术的快速发展，推动着各行各业的数字化转型。<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">信创行业，作为信息技术应用创新的重要领域，其标准化建设对于保障技术安全、促进产业升级、推动经济高质量发展具有重要意义。</strong></span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">信息技术应用创新是推动信息化行业发展的关键动力。《行动计划》提出，要加快基础软件、工业软件、芯片、人工智能（AI）、大模型、算力基础设施等关键信息技术领域的标准研制。这些技术是构建现代信息技术体系的基石，也信创行业需要大力发展的重点领域，其标准化将有助于形成统一的技术规范，促进技术的广泛应用和产业的健康发展。</span></section><section><br/></section><section><section><section><section><br/></section><section><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">0</strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(56, 89, 254); text-shadow: none;\">关键信息技术领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><br/></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">在关键信息技术领域，标准化建设将聚焦于基础软件和工业软件。基础软件包括操作系统、数据库、中间件等，而工业软件则涵盖了计算机辅助设计（CAD）、计算机辅助工程（CAE）、计算机辅助制造（CAM）等。这些软件的标准化将有助于提升软件的互操作性、安全性和可靠性，为工业自动化和智能制造提供坚实的技术支撑。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><br/></section><section><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">0</strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(56, 89, 254); text-shadow: none;\">数字基础设施领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">数字基础设施是支撑数字化转型的基石。《行动计划》强调了完善网络基础设施标准、推进算力基础设施标准研制的重要性。随着5G、6G技术的发展和应用，以及云计算、边缘计算、高性能计算等技术的融合，数字基础设施的标准研制将为构建高效、安全、可靠的数字世界提供规范和指导。</span></section><section><br/></section><section><section><section><section><br/></section><section><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">0</strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">3&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(56, 89, 254); text-shadow: none;\">数据资源领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">数据已成为新的生产要素。《行动计划》提出，要强化数据资源基础标准建设，包括数据采集、存储、访问、使用、销毁等数据技术标准，以及数据治理、数据安全等相关标准。这将有助于保障数据的质量和安全，推动数据的开放共享和价值释放，为数字经济的发展提供动力。</span></section><section><br/></section><section><section><section><section><br/></section><section><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">0</strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">4&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(56, 89, 254); text-shadow: none;\">产业数字化领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">产业数字化是经济转型的重要方向。《行动计划》指出，要提升农业信息化、制造业信息化、服务业信息化的标准水平。通过制定和实施相关标准，可以促进信息技术在各个产业的深度融合，推动产业的数字化、网络化、智能化发展，提高生产效率和产品质量，增强产业的国际竞争力。</span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">结合当前的热点技术，如基础软件、工业软件、芯片、AI、大模型、算力基础设施等，信创行业的标准化建设不仅能够促进这些技术的创新和应用，还能够为整个信息技术产业提供一个健康、有序的发展环境。随着《行动计划》的深入实施，我们有理由相信，信创行业将在标准化建设方面实现新的突破，为推动经济社会的全面数字化转型贡献力量。</span></section><section><br/></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\">《行动计划》提出，要坚持系统观念、坚持需求导向、坚持重点推进、坚持开放合作。到2027年，信息化标准工作机制更加健全，信息化标准体系布局更加完善，标准研制、服务等基础能力进一步夯实，发布一批高质量的信息化标准，形成一支专业化、职业化、国际化的标准化人才队伍，标准质量显著提升，实施效果明显增强，信息化标准在引领技术创新、驱动经济社会发展中的作用充分发挥，国际标准贡献度和影响力明显提升。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\"><br/></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">在产品研发上，万里数据库坚持“极致稳定 极致性能 极致易用”理念，打造了</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(192, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">一种产品、两种部署</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background